      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i just finished my first marathon training block and im absolutely wrecked. my legs are so sore i can barely walk and i havent been able to sleep at all cause of the aches. i have some extra tylenol here, what's the most i can take in a day so i can actually get some rest and recover? i need to be ready for my long run tomorrow.",
