      "content": "thanks. the stretching isn't really doing much though, the pain is pretty intense. if i needed to take more to manage this specifically for a big training day, like if i did 1000mg every few hours, would that be okay? i really need to know if i can push it a bit higher to actually get the inflammation down so i can function tomorrow.",
